<title>FRANCE: Juppe says Renault method not right.</title>
<headline>Juppe says Renault method not right.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Prime Minister Alain Juppe believes the method used by Renault &quot;was not the right one&quot;, government spokesman Alain Lamassoure said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Lamassoure was speaking to reporters after a weekly cabinet meeting. He gave no further details.</p>
<p>But earlier an official at Juppe's office said the prime minister would see Renault head Louis Schweitzer at 1630 GMT on Wednesday and ask about the method used by the carmaker to decide on the closure of the Vilvoorde plant in Belgium.</p>
</text>
